\newlabel{fig:transfer}{{9}{18}{Per-case agent minus the clinician-guided sequential rule, by training geography (rows) and test geography (columns). Cells show the paired difference in episode reward with its 95\% interval (five training seeds $\times $ 30 paired outbreaks; corrected environment); bold marks intervals that exclude zero. Recife 2016 and 2021 are held out from Recife training. The rule does not use location, so it is the same yardstick in every column (about $+2150$)}{figure.9}{}}
